From: v2rayN Dev <dev@v2rayn.local>
Date: Mon, 15 Jun 2026 08:03:27 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] feat: Auto Switch per-profile duration, Order sort (zeros
 last), column persistence

Changes:
- ProfileExItem: add AutoSwitchDuration field (default 30s)
- ProfileItemModel: add AutoSwitchDuration reactive property
- ProfileExManager: add GetAutoSwitchDuration/SetAutoSwitchDuration, init duration=30
- AutoSwitchManager: 1s polling timer with per-profile slot expiry
- ProfilesViewModel: load/sync/subscribe AutoSwitchDuration; special sort for Order col
- ProfilesView.xaml: add Secs column; Tag= on template columns for persistence
- ProfilesView.xaml.cs: GetColumnExName helper; ColumnDisplayIndexChanged for live save
