From e4fdaa0f7a9111a5c26f2ea765ea5b78558a0573 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: v2rayN Dev <dev@v2rayn.local>
Date: Mon, 15 Jun 2026 08:34:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] fix: Order column sort not firing on header click

Two issues prevented the click handler from running on template columns:
1. DataGridTemplateColumn.HeaderStyle overrides the global Style which
   contained the EventSetter - each HeaderStyle now explicitly includes
   its own EventSetter for the Click handler.
2. The TabIndex < 0 guard in LstProfiles_ColumnHeader_Click blocked
   template-column headers (their TabIndex is always -1 in WPF) -
   removed the guard so the click dispatches for all column types.
---
